72
00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:57.490
you were gonna be a teacher.
No, no.

73
00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:58.323
Is that true?

74
00:02:58.323 --> 00:03:00.450
I actually went Columbia College, Chicago,

75
00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:01.330
which is an art school.

76
00:03:01.330 --> 00:03:02.977
That's right.

77
00:03:02.977 --> 00:03:04.570
So I had initially gone into painting

78
00:03:05.754 --> 00:03:07.601
and just kind of to develop credit,

79
00:03:07.601 --> 00:03:10.170
took an education class and the professor and the course

80
00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:13.950
