81
00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:16.730
and the magic that I got to see in preschool classroom,

82
00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:18.400
I was like this is it.

83
00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:19.713
Do you ever feel like,

84
00:03:20.809 --> 00:03:23.007
I feel like my kids are like a fresh start.

85
00:03:23.007 --> 00:03:25.730
Like there's so much hope this formative, shaping

86
00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:28.050
and time is so crucial and important to them.

87
00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:29.982
Absolutely, I'm learning law and policy

88
00:03:29.982 --> 00:03:32.850
so that I can work in advocacy for children

89
00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:34.550
and families within the education system.

90
00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:35.383
Interesting.

91
00:03:35.383 --> 00:03:36.216
Yeah.

92
00:03:36.216 --> 00:03:38.817
So you can advocate for families and children?

93
00:03:38.817 --> 00:03:41.277
Within the education system, yeah.

94
00:03:41.277 --> 00:03:42.550
How are you finding the time to do that?

95
00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:44.400
It's a lot of work, but it's work that I love.

96
00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:46.370
I'm really enjoying it for right now, for sure.

97
00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:49.617
Well, I love your intentions and I love your life choices.

98
00:03:49.617 --> 00:03:54.617
And I love that your path has led you to these places.

99
00:03:55.648 --> 00:03:56.727
(crowd claps)

100
00:03:56.727 --> 00:03:58.858
(crowd applause)

101
00:03:58.858 --> 00:04:00.230
Oh, I love Megan so much.

102
00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:01.962
We had such a beautiful day together.

103
00:04:01.962 --> 00:04:03.244
(crowd applause)

104
00:04:03.244 --> 00:04:05.824
So before the break met an amazing Chicago teacher

105
00:04:05.824 --> 00:04:07.940
named Megan, who I had the pleasure of surprising her

106
00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:09.250
at her school,

107
00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:11.980
but that wasn't the only thing we had in store.

108
00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:14.150
No, no, much bigger and more important things.

109
00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:15.630
Take a look.

110
00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:18.530
I love being in this part of the school

111
00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:21.005
