112
00:04:21.005 --> 00:04:23.755
(crowd applause)

113
00:04:35.318 --> 00:04:37.156
I can feel your energy from a mile away.

114
00:04:37.156 --> 00:04:40.180
And everybody wanted to show up to say that they support you

115
00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:41.475
