00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:05.260 line:15%
you are one of the most compassionate

125
00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:07.543 line:15%
and understanding people ever,

126
00:05:07.543 --> 00:05:10.726 line:15%
you've taught me so much about myself and about education,

127
00:05:10.726 --> 00:05:12.960
you know, I think that as a teacher, an educator,

128
00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:16.430
you inspire me, seeing how much you works through students

129
00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:18.890
and just, you know, how much you give back

130
00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:21.670
and your selflessness say something like, I don't know.

131
00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:24.430
if I get in a small bit of that as a teacher,

132
00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:26.030
I'd call myself lucky.

133
00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:28.110 line:15%
When you came to Schubert School,

