145
00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.740
you saved those children.

146
00:05:57.740 --> 00:06:00.260
Those children needed stability and love

147
00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:04.110
and a person that would be there and be dedicated for them.

148
00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:05.640
And that what you gave to them.

149
00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:07.570
I wanna invite us all to sit down.

150
00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:08.720
Cause as you sit down,

151
00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:11.327
luckily something else will happen too.

152
00:06:11.327 --> 00:06:14.380
This is one element of today.

153
00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:16.567
Joann Stores is going to donate

154
00:06:16.567 --> 00:06:21.102
