158
00:06:33.334 --> 00:06:34.887
For you, Megan.

159
00:06:36.743 --> 00:06:37.576
Thank you so much.

160
00:06:37.576 --> 00:06:39.068
As well, thank you Joann so much, Joann stores.

161
00:06:39.068 --> 00:06:40.570
Thank you, Joann.

162
00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:43.870
And, you know, I have to say, when you talked about

163
00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:48.800
how, when kids, oh,

164
00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:52.260
when they just don't have that stability and that structure

165
00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:54.910
and they're craving it and, you know,

166
00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:58.640
